@startuml
interface Command {
  + void execute()
  + void undo()
}
class LightCommand implements Command
class VolumeCommand implements Command
class MacroCommand implements Command {
  - List<Command> commands
  + void add(Command c)
}
class CinemaHall {
  + void setLight(boolean state)
  + void setVolume(int level)
}
class Operator {
  - List<Command> history
  + void executeCommand(Command c)
  + void undoLast()
}

Operator o--> Command : invokes
MacroCommand o--> Command : contains
LightCommand --> CinemaHall : receiver
VolumeCommand --> CinemaHall : receiver
note right of Command : Command Interface
note right of Operator : Invoker
note right of CinemaHall : Receiver
@enduml
